        "text_CfcJd4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you've recently purchased a Toyota Tundra from Toyota Australia, Offroad Industries has an ideal solution to enhance your truck's capabilities. Our Federally Approved 3850 GVM package is designed to boost your vehicle's performance. Additionally, our team is actively developing an even higher-rated GVM option, targeting 4200 or 4300, so please keep an eye out for upcoming updates.</p><p>Our upgrade features the legendary Fox Performance Elite suspension paired with premium, USA-made BDS components. This combination ensures your truck delivers an exceptional driving experience, handling rough terrain with ease while benefiting from durable, high-quality parts built to last. </p><p>We have also conducted in-depth GCM testing to maximize the performance of your GVM Package and ensure your brake towing capacity remains unaffected.</p>"
          }
